# Keep Android build artefacts out of GitHub's generated source archives.
#
# HA's Marketplace aborts any download above 100 MiB, and android/apk holds 17
# APKs (~492 MiB uncompressed, ~205 MiB compressed) -- practically the whole
# 218 MiB tag archive -- so installs from the built-in Marketplace failed.
# Excluding the folder drops the archive to ~12 MiB.
#
# export-ignore only filters `git archive` output (GitHub's "Download ZIP" and
# the archives the Marketplace fetches). A `git clone` still gets everything.
# NOTE: archives are built from the tree of the ref, so only tags cut after this
# commit are small. Tags from before it stay 218 MiB.
android/       export-ignore
android/**     export-ignore
*.apk          export-ignore
